<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Sepap cancels EBRD loan contract.</title>
<headline>Czech Sepap cancels EBRD loan contract.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech paper maker Sepap a.s. has cancelled an agreement with the European Bank for Reconstruction and Development to lead manage a 111 million mark loan, the Prague Stock Exchange's official bulletin said on Friday.</p>
<p>It added that it would now seek a new manager for the credit, which should be in the &quot;region of 100 million marks&quot;.</p>
</text>
